<% const stamp=locals.assetVersion||'current',sceneLink=file=>'/demo?chapter='+Math.floor((demo.screens.find(s=>s.file===file)?.atMilliseconds||0)/1000),clock=ms=>String(Math.floor(ms/60000)).padStart(2,'0')+':'+String(Math.floor(ms/1000)%60).padStart(2,'0'); %>
<section class="pub-hero">
  <div class="pub-hero__copy"><span class="pub-kicker"><i></i> AI-powered inventory &amp; operations</span><h1>StockChief runs the work between the <em>sale</em> and the <em>books.</em></h1><p>Bring stock, orders, suppliers and Money together. Let StockChief prepare and carry out supported work under your authority, with the decisions that need you in one place.</p><div class="pub-actions"><a class="pub-btn" href="/demo">See StockChief in action <span>↗</span></a><a class="pub-text-link" href="/how-stockchief-works">How the operating loop works <span>→</span></a></div><div class="pub-proofline"><span>Your business records</span><span>Your approval rules</span><span>A traceable result</span></div></div>
  <div class="product-preview" data-product-preview aria-label="Explore StockChief product screens">
    <div class="product-preview__bar"><span><i></i> Explore StockChief</span><a href="/demo">Watch walkthrough ↗</a></div>
    <div class="product-preview__tabs" role="group" aria-label="Choose a product screen"><% for(const [index,screen] of demo.screens.entries()){ %><button type="button" data-preview-file="<%= screen.file %>" data-preview-title="<%= screen.title %>" data-preview-chapter="<%= Math.floor(screen.atMilliseconds/1000) %>" aria-pressed="<%= index===0?'true':'false' %>"><%= ['Stock','Planning','Purchasing','Ask','Home','Import'][index] %></button><% } %></div>
    <a class="product-preview__screen" data-preview-open href="<%= sceneLink('inventory.png') %>" aria-label="Watch inventory by location"><img data-preview-image src="/demo/inventory.png?v=<%= stamp %>" width="1440" height="900" alt="<%= demo.screens[0].title %> · StockChief demonstration"><span class="product-preview__play" aria-hidden="true">▶</span></a>
    <div class="product-preview__caption"><strong data-preview-caption><%= demo.screens[0].title %></strong><span>Product capture · demonstration records</span></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="signal-strip" aria-label="Connected operation"><span>Commerce</span><i></i><span>Inventory</span><i></i><span>Suppliers</span><i></i><span>Orders</span><i></i><span>Shipping</span><i></i><span>Money</span></section>
<section class="pub-section work-story" id="see-it-work" data-reveal><div class="pub-section__heading"><span class="pub-kicker">One connected operation</span><h2>A signal comes in.<br>Move the whole operation forward.</h2><p>Each step uses the same products, locations and business records.</p></div><div class="work-story__track"><article><b>01</b><span class="story-icon">↗</span><h3>Bring the work together</h3><p>Import records and connect supported sales channels, mailboxes, accounting and shipping accounts.</p><a href="/integrations">Explore connections →</a></article><article><b>02</b><span class="story-icon">◌</span><h3>Understand what changed</h3><p>See stock, commitments, incoming supply and the records that explain them.</p><a href="/capabilities">See the capabilities →</a></article><article><b>03</b><span class="story-icon">⌁</span><h3>Prepare the next step</h3><p>Ask StockChief to investigate, prepare supported work or build a report from your records.</p><a href="<%= sceneLink('ask.png') %>">Watch an actual answer →</a></article><article><b>04</b><span class="story-icon">✓</span><h3>Keep control of the outcome</h3><p>Review required decisions, follow recorded progress and inspect the result.</p><a href="/control">Understand your controls →</a></article></div><a class="pub-inline-cta" href="/demo"><span>See the current product in use</span><b>Watch the recorded walkthrough →</b></a></section>
<section class="pub-section capability-stage" data-reveal><div class="pub-section__heading pub-section__heading--row"><div><span class="pub-kicker">What it handles</span><h2>The work between the stock count and the books.</h2></div><a class="pub-text-link" href="/capabilities">Explore every capability →</a></div><div class="capability-grid">
<article class="capability-card capability-card--wide"><span class="capability-card__number">01</span><div><small>Inventory you can explain</small><h3>Know what is on hand, available and incoming.</h3><p>Products, variants, locations, lots, serials and the movements behind each balance.</p></div><a class="recorded-capture" href="<%= sceneLink('inventory.png') %>"><img src="/demo/inventory.png?v=<%= stamp %>" loading="lazy" alt="Actual StockChief inventory screen with demonstration records" width="1440" height="900"></a></article>
<article class="capability-card"><span class="capability-card__number">02</span><small>Buy &amp; move</small><h3>Purchasing with the facts in view.</h3><p>Supplier costs, lead times, purchase orders, transfers and physical receipts remain connected.</p><a href="<%= sceneLink('purchasing.png') %>" class="pub-text-link">See the purchase order →</a></article>
<article class="capability-card"><span class="capability-card__number">03</span><small>Sell &amp; fulfill</small><h3>Carry the order through.</h3><p>Reservations, partial fulfillment, shipments, invoices and returns keep their supporting records.</p><a href="/capabilities" class="pub-text-link">Explore order operations →</a></article>
<article class="capability-card capability-card--ink"><span class="capability-card__number">04</span><small>Understand &amp; respond</small><h3>Ask in your own words.</h3><p>Find a business fact, investigate an issue or prepare a supported action. Consequential changes follow your authority.</p><a class="recorded-capture" href="<%= sceneLink('ask.png') %>"><img src="/demo/ask.png?v=<%= stamp %>" loading="lazy" alt="Actual stock answer using the demonstration business records" width="1440" height="900"></a></article>
<article class="capability-card"><span class="capability-card__number">05</span><small>Money</small><h3>Understand the money behind the operation.</h3><p>See customer balances, supplier bills, inventory value and profit, with the records behind each amount.</p><a class="pub-text-link" href="/capabilities">Explore Money →</a></article></div></section>
<section class="day-section" data-reveal><div class="day-section__copy"><span class="pub-kicker pub-kicker--light">A closer look at StockChief</span><h2>The product, in motion.<br>The records, in context.</h2><p>Follow the actual application in a fresh demonstration business. Every chapter below opens the matching point in the recording.</p><a class="pub-btn" href="/demo">Watch the full walkthrough ↗</a><p class="recording-note">Synthetic demo records. Captured from the working application.</p></div><div class="day-timeline"><% for(const scene of demo.screens){ %><a class="recorded-chapter" href="/demo?chapter=<%= Math.floor(scene.atMilliseconds/1000) %>"><time><%= clock(scene.atMilliseconds) %></time><i class="is-green"></i><div><small>Recorded product walkthrough</small><strong><%= scene.title %></strong><span>Open this chapter</span></div><b>↗</b></a><% } %></div></section>
<section class="pub-section connected-section" data-reveal><div class="connected-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit-center"><span class="pub-brand__mark" aria-hidden="true"><%- include('../components/brand-symbol') %></span><b>StockChief</b><small>Your connected operation</small></div><span class="orbit-node orbit-node--one">Store</span><span class="orbit-node orbit-node--two">Mailbox</span><span class="orbit-node orbit-node--three">Carrier</span><span class="orbit-node orbit-node--four">Payments</span><span class="orbit-node orbit-node--five">Books</span><span class="orbit-node orbit-node--six">Warehouse</span></div><div class="connected-section__copy"><span class="pub-kicker">Connected operation</span><h2>The systems you use.<br>One place to run the work.</h2><p>Connect your own accounts. Available reads, writes and synchronization depend on the provider, granted access and your plan.</p><div class="connection-list"><% for(const group of groups){ %><span><b><%= group.title %></b><% for(const provider of group.providers){ %> <a data-home-provider="<%= provider.type %>" href="/integrations#group-<%= group.title.toLowerCase().replaceAll(' ','-') %>"><%= provider.name %></a><% } %></span><% } %></div><a class="pub-text-link" href="/integrations">Explore supported connections →</a></div></section>
<section class="control-band" data-reveal><div><span class="pub-kicker pub-kicker--light">Control without micromanagement</span><h2>You set the boundary.<br>Keep the decisions that matter.</h2></div><div class="control-band__rules"><article><span>Authority</span><b>Choose what may run automatically</b></article><article><span>Approvals</span><b>Review changes that need your decision</b></article><article><span>Evidence</span><b>Follow the records behind the result</b></article><article><span>Control</span><b>Pause connected work when needed</b></article></div><a href="/control">See how authority and evidence work →</a></section>
<section class="pub-section switching-section" data-reveal><div><span class="pub-kicker">Bring the records you have</span><h2>Review the interpretation.<br>Then bring it into your business.</h2><p>Start with a spreadsheet, document, readable image or supported system. StockChief preserves source fields, shows questions and prepares a preview before you approve changes.</p><a class="pub-btn pub-btn--secondary" href="/switching">How switching works →</a></div><a class="import-visual recorded-capture" href="<%= sceneLink('import.png') %>"><img src="/demo/import.png?v=<%= stamp %>" loading="lazy" alt="Actual import preview, prepared without importing stock" width="1440" height="900"><span class="capture-caption">Actual preview · nothing imported</span></a></section>
<section class="scale-strip"><span>Products &amp; variants</span><i>→</i><span>Multiple locations</span><i>→</i><span>Connected systems</span><p>Choose the plan and operating scope that fit your business.</p><a href="/pricing">Compare plans →</a></section>
<section class="pub-final" data-reveal><span class="pub-kicker">Your operation, connected</span><h2>Put StockChief to work<br>on your business.</h2><p>Explore the product. Choose a paid plan with a 14-day money-back guarantee.</p><div class="pub-actions pub-actions--center"><a class="pub-btn" href="/pricing">Find your plan</a><a class="pub-btn pub-btn--secondary" href="/demo">See StockChief in action</a></div></section>
